Revision history for Poker-Eval

0.10    2026-08-20
        - Add Poker::Game named-variant API (Holdem, Omaha, draw, stud, Badugi, …)
        - Only Poker::Eval defines $VERSION (cleaner CPAN index)
        - Joker support via Poker::Deck / Poker::Dealer joker_count
        - Equity and street helpers on the Game layer
        - Expanded test suite

0.09    2016
        - Prior CPAN release

0.01    January 3, 2016
        - Initial release
